   clearly marked exception (owner decision still pending as of round
   5 — see the PAGE GOAL comment above). `tone` picks each strip's
   panel color — one of each from the existing .badge-brand/gold/
   slate/muted family so all 4 strips read as distinct blocks in one
   palette, not four identical rows. Fuel/travel/marketing data below
   updated this round to match the finalized copy; Reception is
   byte-identical to round 4. */
const strips = [
  {
