    ],
    href:      "/systems/fuel-distribution",
    linkLabel: "Read the full story",
  },
  {
    heading: "A travel agency, two systems built back to back",
    subline: "Two custom systems: an internal tools portal and WhatsApp automation, including a dedicated interface.",
